es. Track request/attempt caps and costs. `finish` is permitted only once the instance is over.\n4. On every response, output exactly one permitted action object on the final line; include no explanatory prose or other content. Treat the action protocol as a hard output constraint, including after demos and incorrect feedback.\n",
